{"step_index":384,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:27:37Z","thinking":"**Examining the Reverse Proxy Config**\n\nThe configuration for port 443 reveals a reverse proxy setup. This setup forwards traffic to an internal IP address. Key directives include setting `X-Forwarded-Proto` and `X-Forwarded-Ssl` headers, and redirecting HTTP to HTTPS.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Configuration for Port 9443**\n\nThe configuration focuses on handling HTTPS traffic on port 9443, using the same SSL certificate as port 443. It includes directives for logging, security, and a reverse proxy to an internal HTTPS service, ensuring the correct headers and HTTPS redirection. Specifically, the `proxy_pass` directive targets the internal Tomcat service on 172.30.198.50:9443.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"~/.ansible/kssh -u superuser 172.30.198.33 '\\ncat << '\\\\''EOF'\\\\'' | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf > /dev/null\\nserver {\\n    listen              172.30.198.33:443 ssl http2 reuseport;\\n    server_name         extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr;\\n\\n    # SSL\\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\\n\\n    # security\\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\\n\\n    # logging\\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\\n\\n    # Redirection explicite racine → /centreon/\\n    location = / {\\n        return 301 /centreon/;\\n    }\\n\\n    # Location block to forward LoRaWAN traffic to backend server on port 8443\\n    location /lorawan/data {\\n        proxy_pass http://172.30.198.49:8443/lorawan/data;\\n        include nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\\n        \\n        # Standard proxy headers\\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl on;\\n        \\n        # Ensure Nginx passes all custom and standard client request headers\\n        proxy_pass_request_headers on;\\n        \\n        # Allow extra large or custom header buffers if needed\\n        proxy_headers_hash_max_size 1024;\\n        proxy_headers_hash_bucket_size 128;\\n    }    \\n\\n    # reverse proxy vers Centreon Web backend\\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass http://172.30.198.49;\\n        include    nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl   on;\\n        proxy_redirect http:// https://;\\n        proxy_headers_hash_max_size 1024;\\n        pr\n<truncated 1961 bytes>","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Running command\"","toolSummary":"\"Deploy perfected vhost on reverse proxy\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
{"step_index":385,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:27:45Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T16:27:45+04:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/task-385\nTask Description: ~/.ansible/kssh -u superuser 172.30.198.33 '\ncat << '\\''EOF'\\'' | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf > /dev/null\nserver {\n    listen              172.30.198.33:443 ssl http2 reuseport;\n    server_name         extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr;\n\n    # SSL\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\n\n    # security\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\n\n    # logging\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\n\n    # Redirection explicite racine → /centreon/\n    location = / {\n        return 301 /centreon/;\n    }\n\n    # Location block to forward LoRaWAN traffic to backend server on port 8443\n    location /lorawan/data {\n        proxy_pass http://172.30.198.49:8443/lorawan/data;\n        include nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\n        \n        # Standard proxy headers\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl on;\n        \n        # Ensure Nginx passes all custom and standard client request headers\n        proxy_pass_request_headers on;\n        \n        # Allow extra large or custom header buffers if needed\n        proxy_headers_hash_max_size 1024;\n        proxy_headers_hash_bucket_size 128;\n    }    \n\n    # reverse proxy vers Centreon Web backend\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass http://172.30.198.49;\n        include    nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl\n<truncated 356 bytes>\n//$host$request_uri;\n}\n\n# HTTPS redirect MAP\nserver {\n    listen              9443 ssl http2 reuseport;\n    server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;\n\n    # SSL (même certificat Let'\\''s Encrypt que :443)\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\n\n    # security\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\n\n    # logging (nouveaux fichiers dédiés — pour ne pas polluer les logs du :443)\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-9443-access.log;\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-9443-error.log warn;\n\n    # Redirection explicite racine → /centreon-map/\n    location = / {\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\n    }\n\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\n\n        include                    nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\n        proxy_set_header Host      $http_host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl   on;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Port  9443;\n\n        proxy_redirect             http:// https://;\n        proxy_headers_hash_max_size   1024;\n        proxy_headers_hash_bucket_size 128;\n    }\n\n    # additional config\n    include nginxconfig.io/general.conf;\n}\nEOF\n\n# Test syntax and reload\nsudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx\n'\nTask logs are available at: file:///home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/tasks/task-385.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
